WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.360
¿Qué más necesito saber?

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:13.800
Your container

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:14.800
where you keep your

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.520
parents’ paintings...

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:18.160
What?

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.600
This morning, I

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.160
moved everything away.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.200
And turns out it was a good call,

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.720
because somebody planted drugs

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:28.880
there.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.880
I think they were trying to set you up.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:43.680
So...

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.400
The paintings are safe?

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.520
Yeah.
